# GludioCleric's clan-attacked hook on Aden's cleric (35237), whose MAGIC_HEAL is the shipped
# Aden Heal (4115). A hit's clan calls run before the hit lowers the knight's hit points, so
# the cleric reads what the knight (35235) had before it: at full hit points, and then at 270
# of 440 (61%), the calls leave it idle; at 260 (59%), with a draw under 20, it wants to cast
# its heal on the knight, walking to it, weight 1000000, and casts it at its next think (an
# NPC first idles on its second cycle).
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioCleric
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioHold
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioHold.GludioKnight
npc knight 35235 SiegeGuard 100 0 0 walks clan aden_siege_clan 300
npc cleric 35237 SiegeGuard 100 150 0 walks clan aden_siege_clan 300 skill MAGIC_HEAL 4115 1

hit knight 170
  desires cleric -

hit knight 10
  desires cleric -

hit knight 10
  desires cleric cast(knight,4115,move)=1000000

tick x2
  S MagicSkillUse caster=cleric target=knight skill=4115-1 hit=13214 reuse=26428 success=0
